# SmartTutor AI - Environment Variables Example
#
# HOW TO USE THIS FILE:
# 1. Make a copy of this file and rename the copy to ".env"
# 2. Replace the text below with your real Gemini API key
# 3. Never share your real .env file or upload it to GitHub
#
# You can get a free API key from Google AI Studio:
# https://aistudio.google.com/apikey

GEMINI_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
